          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Listen to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s case against Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arise, O ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and present your case; let the mountains and the hills hear what you say.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You mountains, you everlasting foundations of the earth, listen to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s case! The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has a case against his people. He is going to bring an accusation against Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says, “My people, what have I done to you? How have I been a burden to you? Answer me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.4.10+EXO.4.11+EXO.4.12+EXO.4.13+EXO.4.14+EXO.4.15+EXO.4.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 4.10–16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.50+EXO.12.51"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "12.50–51",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.15.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15.20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I brought you out of Egypt; I rescued you from slavery; I sent Moses, Aaron, and Miriam to lead you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Num 22.2—24.25; Josh 3.1—4.19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My people, remember what King Balak of Moab planned to do to you and how Balaam son of Beor answered him. Remember the things that happened on the way from the camp at Acacia to Gilgal. Remember these things and you will realize what I did in order to save you.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What shall I bring to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of heaven, when I come to worship him? Shall I bring the best calves to burn as offerings to him? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Will the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " be pleased if I bring him thousands of sheep or endless streams of olive oil? Shall I offer him my firstborn child to pay for my sins? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has told us what is good. What he requires of us is this: to do what is just, to show constant love, and to live in humble fellowship with our God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is wise to fear the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". He calls to the city, “Listen, you people who assemble in the city!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6.9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Probable text",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "who assemble in the city",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "and who appointed it. Yet.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the houses of evil people are treasures which they got dishonestly. They use false measures, a thing that I hate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6.10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Verse 10 in Hebrew is unclear.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How can I forgive those who use false scales and weights? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Your rich people exploit the poor, and all of you are liars. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I have already begun",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6.13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Some ancient translations",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "begun",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "made ill.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " your ruin and destruction because of your sins. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You will eat, but not be satisfied — in fact you will still be hungry. You will carry things off, but you will not be able to save them; anything you do save I will destroy in war. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You will sow corn, but not harvest the crop. You will press oil from olives, but never be able to use it. You will make wine, but never drink it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.16.23+1KI.16.24+1KI.16.25+1KI.16.26+1KI.16.27+1KI.16.28+1KI.16.29+1KI.16.30+1KI.16.31+1KI.16.32+1KI.16.33+1KI.16.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kgs 16.23–34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.21.25+1KI.21.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21.25–26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This will happen because you have followed the evil practices of King Omri and of his son, King Ahab. You have continued their policies, and so I will bring you to ruin, and everyone will despise you. People",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6.16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "One ancient translation",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "People",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "My people.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " everywhere will treat you with contempt.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6.16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "People",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "contempt",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "As my people you will everywhere be treated with contempt.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
